            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ",
            "review_text": "Mashajo\nKaliningrad, Russia11690 contributions\n12\nKorean cuisine in tz\nAug 2025 • Solo\nWent into this restaurant while walking through the mall. The establishment is spacious, clean, with a pleasant environment. The staff is friendly, the service is quick. The restaurant specializes in Korean BBQ, and there is a buffet format, as well as the possibility to order dishes on menu. I chose kimchitige. The order came in pretty quickly. Panchan was served first - everything was fresh and delicious. The soup itself is served in a hot stone pot, which keeps the temperature of the dish. The taste is rich, slightly sharp, all prepared with quality. The service is attentive. It's a good place to eat Korean food while shopping.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten April 2, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
