            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ",
            "review_text": "Luthfil Hadi Ng\nSingapore, Singapore20 contributions\n0\nKorean BBQ that is one of a kind…\nNov 2024 • Couples\nI have tried Korean BBQ multiple places and times. The staff were friendly and polite however, the food does not do its justice. After cooking, most of the food I ate like red meat and seafood. It was rubbery. Yes this restaurant is a buffet style however, it is not the typical buffet style where you can pick and choose yourself. They are using the order from the menu style. We chose the set where there is both grilling and hotpot. However, it was not served together. After eating heartily all the grilled food, then the staff asked “you want the hotpot now ?” I felt it should be served together. All in all it was just average for me.\nRead more\nWritten November 15, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
